      "content": "\"wake up\"... that sounds nice but it feels more like i'm just standing on the edge of something. like there's this massive gap between me and everything else. it's like i've seen something real and now everything else is just noise that doesn't matter. it makes me wonder if there's even a point to staying in this version of things.",
